  "summary": {
    "text": "Mistral Small, later named Mistral Small 1.0, is a language model that Mistral AI released on 26 February 2024 alongside Mistral Large, through the mistral-small-2402 API endpoint and in le Chat. Mistral AI positioned it between its open-weight models and its flagship model, optimised for latency and cost, with function calling and JSON mode at launch.",
