  "notes": "First model named Mistral Small, released together with Mistral Large in the post Au Large. The earlier mistral-small endpoint (from 2023-12-11) served Mixtral 8x7B and was renamed open-mixtral-8x7b on 2024-02-26; that is no lineage, so no relation is recorded. Mistral's September 2024 post (AI in abundance, https://mistral.ai/news/september-24-release/) calls this model Mistral Small v24.02; the docs call it Mistral Small 1.0 (version 24.02). The slug ends in -1 because the family id is mistral.mistral-small."
